  "details": "I noticed there are very old requests:\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/feature-requests/p/add-ability-specifying-world-instance-and-accessibility-to-vrcportalmarker\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/feature-requests/p/vrcportalmarker-set-room-type\n\nThey are requests from 2018. But it's NEVER adjusted.\nThe only difference i want put ready to go portals here but they are set like Friends+ or Invite+ (what you can choose in Unity) because all portals are set as Public, and that is not always good for some special worlds or big worlds you dont want show it public for own reason due content there or avoid unwanted visitors if world is heavy.\n(except some worlds are non-public set)\n\nI miss this function now and the website link is another nice  feature but it cannot used ingame. So add more options to portals.\n\nThank you.",
